---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/inbox.css';
---
<Layout title="资料收件箱" active="inbox" description="让收集的资料，慢慢成为自己的知识。">
  <div class="shell inbox-page">
    <header class="inbox-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">THE READING DESK / 资料收件箱</span>
        <h1>收下灵感，<br />再把它<span>读懂。</span></h1>
        <p>
          给刚遇见的知识一个落点。整理、归入路线、动手验证，
          <br class="inbox-desktop-break" />让收藏不止于收藏。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="inbox-hero-aside">
        <span class="inbox-desk-mark" aria-hidden="true">↳</span>
        <p>从收集，到理解。</p>
        <a href="/manage/" class="button button-primary">写作与导入 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <nav id="inbox-tabs" class="inbox-tabs" aria-label="整理进度">
      <button type="button" data-view="pending" aria-pressed="true">待整理 <span>—</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-view="unassigned" aria-pressed="false">未归路线 <span>—</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-view="unverified" aria-pressed="false">待验证 <span>—</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-view="verified" aria-pressed="false">已验证 <span>—</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-view="all" aria-pressed="false">全部资料 <span>—</span></button>
    </nav>
    <section class="inbox-workbench" aria-label="资料整理">
      <form id="inbox-filter-form" class="inbox-filter-form">
        <label class="inbox-search-label" for="inbox-search">
          搜索资料
          <input
            id="inbox-search"
            type="search"
            maxlength="256"
            placeholder="标题、摘要、标签或系列…"
            aria-describedby="inbox-search-help"
          />
        </label>
        <label for="inbox-tag">
          标签
          <select id="inbox-tag"><option value="">全部标签</option></select>
        </label>
        <label for="inbox-route">
          所属路线
          <select id="inbox-route"><option value="">全部路线</option></select>
        </label>
        <button id="inbox-filter-submit" class="button" type="submit">应用筛选</button>
      </form>
      <p id="inbox-search-help" class="inbox-fine-print">
        这里搜索资料元数据，包含草稿；正文全文检索请使用全站搜索。
        整理状态独立保存，不会修改正文或发布文章。
      </p>
      <p id="inbox-route-warning" class="inbox-notice" hidden>
        该筛选对应的路线已删除。筛选仍被保留，你可以选择其他路线。
      </p>
      <details class="inbox-views">
        <summary>我的筛选视图 <span>跨设备保留常用入口</span></summary>
        <div id="inbox-saved-views" class="inbox-saved-views"></div>
        <form id="inbox-view-form" class="inbox-view-form">
          <label for="inbox-view-name">
            视图名称
            <input id="inbox-view-name" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：正在验证的资料" required />
          </label>
          <button id="inbox-save-view" class="button" type="submit">保存当前筛选</button>
        </form>
      </details>
      <section id="inbox-batch" class="inbox-batch" aria-label="批量整理">
        <div>
          <strong id="inbox-selected-count">尚未选择资料</strong>
          <p>每次最多 100 篇；只更新整理进度。</p>
        </div>
        <label for="inbox-stage">
          整理进度
          <select id="inbox-stage">
            <option value="organized">待验证</option>
            <option value="verified">已验证</option>
            <option value="pending">待整理</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button id="inbox-apply" class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled>更新所选进度</button>
        <button id="inbox-clear-selection" class="button" type="button" disabled>清除选择</button>
      </section>
      <div class="inbox-list-heading">
        <label class="inbox-checkbox-label"><input id="inbox-select-page" type="checkbox" />选择本页</label>
        <span id="inbox-count" class="mono"></span>
      </div>
      <p id="inbox-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在打开你的资料收件箱…</p>
      <div class="inbox-recovery">
        <button id="inbox-retry" class="button" type="button" hidden>重新读取</button>
        <button id="inbox-conflict-reload" class="button" type="button" hidden>读取最新状态，保留选择</button>
      </div>
      <div id="inbox-results" class="inbox-results" aria-busy="true"></div>
      <section id="inbox-empty" class="inbox-empty" hidden>
        <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
        <h2>给下一次好奇，留一点空白。</h2>
        <p>这个筛选下暂无资料。可以调整条件，或从写作空间导入一份文档。</p>
        <button id="inbox-clear-filter" class="button" type="button">查看全部资料</button>
        <a href="/manage/" class="quiet-link">去写作与导入 ↗</a>
      </section>
      <nav class="inbox-pagination" aria-label="资料分页">
        <button id="inbox-previous" class="button" type="button" disabled>上一页</button>
        <span id="inbox-page-number"></span>
        <button id="inbox-next" class="button" type="button" disabled>下一页</button>
      </nav>
    </section>

  </div>
  <script>
    import '../scripts/inbox/index';
  </script>
</Layout>
